This licence covers the code in this repository. It does not cover the
annotated corpora the code is trained and evaluated on, which are not
redistributed here and carry their own terms:

  ReM  Referenzkorpus Mittelhochdeutsch (1050-1350), v2.1
       Roussel, Klein, Dipper, Wegera, Wich-Reif (2024)
       https://www.linguistics.rub.de/rem/

  ReF  Reference Corpus Early New High German (1350-1650), v1.0.2
       Wegera, Solms, Demske, Dipper (2021)
       https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5793616

  ReN  Reference Corpus Middle Low German / Low Rhenish (1200-1650), v1.1
       ReN-Team (2021)
       https://doi.org/10.25592/uhhfdm.9195

  LeA  Referenzkorpus Altdeutsch, reading-corpus layer
       Donhauser, Gippert, Luhr (2018)
       http://hdl.handle.net/11022/0000-0007-C9C7-6

meta/ contains tables derived from these corpora (manuscript metadata, a
spelling-layer pair list and a normalisation lookup). Anyone redistributing
them should check the terms of the corpus each is derived from.

legacy/ preserves the earlier mpi4py implementation of Hydra for reference.
